    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSunnybank is a well-maintained four-bedroom detached bungalow ideally situated in Glanmire, offering a peaceful countryside setting while remaining just a short drive from Cork city.\n\nAccommodation briefly comprises a welcoming porch, entrance hall, living/dining room, sitting room, kitchen, utility room, guest W.C., family bathroom, three double bedrooms, one of which benefits from a private en-suite, and a fourth single bedroom. All accommodation is conveniently arranged on the ground floor.\n\nTo the front, a large driveway provides ample off-street parking, while the mature garden is planted with a variety of shrubs, plants, and hedging, creating a private and attractive setting.\n\nThe fully enclosed rear garden is mainly laid to lawn and features a selection of mature trees, shrubs, and planting. A paved patio area provides an ideal space for outdoor dining, while a spacious concrete yard and detached storage shed offer excellent additional storage. The property also enjoys pleasant open countryside views to the rear.\n\nPresented in excellent decorative condition throughout, this home is ready for immediate occupation and is ideally suited to a range of purchasers seeking space, comfort, and convenience.\n\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate all that this home has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nPorch - \nA bright entrance porch enhanced by exposed stonework, tiled flooring, and double-glazed French doors.\n\nEntrance Hall - 3.77m x 1.87m / 7.69m x 0.88m\nA welcoming entrance hall featuring a combination of tiled and carpet flooring, providing access to all accommodation throughout the home.\n\nLiving/Dining Room - 3.90m x 9.43m\nSpacious dual-aspect living/dining room overlooking the front driveway, featuring laminate wood flooring and an attractive feature fireplace. Accessed from both the entrance hall and sitting room via double doors.\n\nSitting Room - 3.99m x 5.11m\nBright and spacious sitting room overlooking the rear garden, featuring timber flooring, fitted storage units, and an attractive electric fireplace. Conveniently positioned with direct access to the kitchen and connects seamlessly with the living/dining room.\n\nKitchen - 3.88m x 4.43m\nThe kitchen is positioned to the rear of the home and is fitted with a good range of floor and eye-level units, integrated appliances, a tiled splashback, and tiled flooring throughout. A sliding glass door provides direct access to the mature rear garden.\n\nUtility Room - 2.91m x 2.96m\nConvenient utility room accessed off the kitchen, fitted with a range of floor and eye-level units and plumbed for a washing machine and dryer.\n\nW.C. - 0.86m x 1.79m\nWell-appointed guest w.c. featuring a two-piece suite, tiled flooring, and a fitted storage unit.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.51m x 4.79m\nLarge double bedroom positioned to the front of the home, featuring fitted wardrobes, carpet flooring, and the benefit of a private en-suite.\n\nEn-Suite - 2.09m x 0.98m\nFully tiled en-suite comprising a two-piece suite with a power shower fitting, complete with a heated towel rail.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.40m x 2.60m\nLarge double bedroom overlooking the rear garden, featuring carpet flooring and built-in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.50m x 3.59m\nGenerously sized double bedroom positioned to the front of the home, featuring carpet flooring and built-in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.38m x 2.65m\nSingle bedroom positioned to the rear of the home with built in wardrobes.\n\nFamily Bathroom - 3.36m x 1.73m\nFully tiled family bathroom comprising a four-piece suite, including a bathtub and walk-in shower with electric shower fitting. The room also features quality bathroom accessories, a wash hand basin with built-in storage, and a heated towel rail.\n\n"
      },
